# Lunduke Linux Kernel: default ISO kernel for 0.9.5.
# Seeded 7.2.15-lcos33 on 2026-11-06 CT for LCOS 1.0.1 (lunduke-linux-kernel
# master 7b7536ca, PR #30, tag 7.2.15-lcos33); see
# config/packages.chroot/SEED-llk-7.2.15-lcos33.txt.
# Replaced 7.2.15-lcos32 (moved to config/packages.chroot/superseded/).
# lcos30 is a new kernel release (7.2.15-lunduke), so the image/headers
# package names changed. Keep this list, the KVER in
# config/hooks/live/0095-lunduke-initramfs.hook.chroot and the seeded debs in step.
# (lcos4-lcos28 all used the single 7.2.6-lunduke release.)
# lcos18: DM_CRYPT=m + XTS (#123), UHID=m (#120), RMI4_F11=y (#121).
# lcos19: radeon=m, vga_switcheroo, DC_SI, HSA, FW compress (#115/#118); 948 modules.
# lcos20: EXFAT_FS=m, iocharset utf8 (#131); 949 modules.
# lcos21: VMD=m (Intel VMD / "RAID On" NVMe), HOTPLUG_PCI_PCIE=y; 950 modules.
# lcos22: RTW89_8852CU/8852BU/8851BU/8922AU=m, RTW88_8814AE=m (#138); 955 modules.
# lcos23: CHROMEOS_LAPTOP=m, MOUSE_CYAPA=m (Chromebook touchpads, #141); 957 modules.
# lcos24: Ubuntu 26.10 HW gap (IPU cameras, Logitech HID++, joydev/xpad/Steam, Intel thermal, AMD_HSMP/TAC5XX2, ACPI_ALS); 1015 modules. No Forced Rust.
# lcos25: UDF_FS=m (#149), LEDS_CLASS_FLASH=m + LEDS_BRIGHTNESS_HW_CHANGED=y (TUXEDO keyboard, kernel#14); 1017 modules.
# lcos27: SATA_SIL24=m, SATA_MV=m, HOTPLUG_PCI_ACPI=y, USB_XHCI_PCI_RENESAS=m (ExpressCard/eSATA); 1020 modules.
# lcos28: KEYBOARD_APPLESPI=m (MacBook8,1 SPI keyboard/trackpad); 1021 modules.
# lcos30: Linux 7.2.15; SND_ENS1371=m, INTEL_THC_HID/QUICKI2C/QUICKSPI=m, HID_HAPTIC=y, ZRAM=m (zstd); 1027 modules.
# lcos31: HID_RMI (#182), IXGBE (#183), net sched/cls/act (#184), B44 + IWL3945 (#187), INTEL_SKL_INT3472 camera, 7.2 survey easy batch; 1088 modules.
# lcos32: ACPI_SBS=m (#191, MacBook Air 2014 smart battery); 1090 modules.
# lcos33: WireGuard, IPv6 policy routing, OVPN, INET ESP/AH, FQ/CAKE, VLAN/macvlan/ipvlan, rt2x00, ATH5K, ATL1C/E, HID gaming, VMware balloon, Galaxy Book/MSI/Uniwill; 1133 modules.
linux-image-7.2.15-lunduke
linux-headers-7.2.15-lunduke
lunduke-linux-kernel
